{
  "spec_version": "0.2",
  "description": "On a prefix-bound model, summarizing up to a turn changes what the kept lines follow, so their thinking signatures no longer verify: the boundary carries replay_fallback and every request of the epoch renders with degraded replay (the drop_block binding).",
  "agent": {
    "nickname": "Tater",
    "instructions": "Be brief.",
